## Week 5: TypeScript Mastery & Testing (Medium Impact)

### Daily Structure (2 hours)
**Morning (1 hour): Advanced TypeScript**
- Generics, utility types, conditional types
- Focus: Real-world applications
- Goal: TypeScript expertise

**Afternoon (1 hour): Testing Patterns**
- Vitest, component testing
- Focus: Test-driven development
- Goal: Quality assurance

### Daily Schedule
| Day | TypeScript Topic | Testing Focus | sanglogium Task |
|-----|------------------|--------------|----------------|
| Mon | Generics | Unit testing | Add generic types |
| Tue | Utility Types | Component testing | Type-safe utilities |
| Wed | Conditional Types | Integration tests | Advanced typing |
| Thu | Type Inference | E2E testing | Type inference optimization |
| Fri | Real-world Patterns | Test strategies | Comprehensive typing |
| Sat | Practice | Mock interviews | Code review |
| Sun | Review | Pattern summary | Documentation |

### Success Metrics
- ✅ Implement 5 advanced TypeScript patterns
- ✅ Write tests for critical components
- ✅ Achieve 100% type safety

