## Week 6: Interview Simulation & Polish (Medium Impact)

### Daily Structure (2 hours)
**Morning (1 hour): Mock Interviews**
- Timed problem solving
- Focus: Communication, clarity
- Goal: Interview performance

**Afternoon (1 hour): Polish & Refinement**
- Resume optimization
- Polish market specifics
- Goal: Professional presentation

### Daily Schedule
| Day | Interview Focus | Polish Task | sanglogium Task |
|-----|----------------|-------------|----------------|
| Mon | Technical screening | Resume review | Final code cleanup |
| Tue | System design | Cover letter | Documentation |
| Wed | Behavioral prep | LinkedIn profile | Portfolio update |
| Thu | Full mock interview | Salary negotiation | Project presentation |
| Fri | Company research | Polish market prep | Final review |
| Sat | Rest & recovery | Light reading | Relax |
| Sun | Final prep | Confidence building | Ready mindset |

### Success Metrics
- ✅ 80%+ mock interview success rate
- ✅ Clear technical communication
- ✅ Professional presentation ready

